    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a practical interest in mathematics, especially in economics and computer science. As a self-employed person, I use basic math daily—budgeting, forecasting, and analyzing data. My parents both had PhDs, so I grew up with a strong foundation. I don’t see math as abstract theory but as a tool for real-world decisions, like managing finances or understanding trends in the economy.",
