    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools last year to help me understand economic models and data analysis. I used a chatbot to explain concepts like regression and probability. It was helpful—clear, concise, and practical. I didn’t rely on it for complex derivations, but it made learning more accessible. I appreciated how it could walk me through examples without overwhelming me.",
